WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.740
1:12 AM. Somebody just booked your studio.

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:12.497
Studio B. Saturday at eight. Deposit's already paid.

00:00:16.902 --> 00:00:23.076
Reminders go out on their own. Your calendars stay in sync. No-shows stop costing you.

00:00:25.178 --> 00:00:30.882
Session day. The artist checks in at the door. Your engineer clocks in from their phone.

00:00:33.453 --> 00:00:39.569
Every patch change, logged in the session notes while you work. Recall is one tap away.

00:00:41.729 --> 00:00:47.164
Split sheet signed. Credits on record. Files stay locked until the balance clears.

00:00:50.005 --> 00:00:57.384
Invoice paid. Payroll handled. Your profit, right there. And when a slot opens up, the fill offer's already drafted.

00:00:58.281 --> 00:01:02.679
That's one session. That's how Pulse changes a studio.

00:01:04.488 --> 00:01:07.768
Let Pulse be the change your studio needs.
